@startuml Ticket Lookup Endpoint Workflow
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBackgroundColor #F8F9FA
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #E3F2FD
skinparam sequenceActorBackgroundColor #FFF3E0
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
skinparam noteBorderColor #FBC02D

title Ticket Lookup Endpoint - Complete Workflow

actor Client as C
participant "API Gateway" as API
participant "Ticket Controller" as TC
participant "WHMCS Service" as WS
participant "WHMCS API" as WHMCS
database "WHMCS Database" as DB

== Request Validation ==
C -> API: POST /api/ticketLookup\n{"phone":"923335113646","ticket":"139242"}
API -> TC: Route to ticketLookupController.getTicketSummary()

TC -> TC: Validate Parameters
note right: • Check phone exists\n• Check ticket exists\n• Validate phone format (≥10 digits)\n• Validate ticket format (numeric)

alt Invalid Parameters
    TC -> API: 400 Bad Request\n{"success":false,"error":"phone/ticket required"}
    API -> C: Error Response
    stop
end

== Ticket Lookup Strategy ==
TC -> WS: getTicketWithClientValidation(ticketNumber, phone)

WS -> WS: **Step 1: Direct Lookup**
WS -> WHMCS: GetTicket(ticketid: "139242")
WHMCS -> DB: SELECT * FROM tickets WHERE id = 139242
DB -> WHMCS: Ticket Data
WHMCS -> WS: Ticket Details

alt Direct Lookup Success
    note right of WS: searchMethod = "direct"
else Direct Lookup Fails
    WS -> WS: **Step 2: Parallel Department Search**
    
    par Support Department Search
        WS -> WHMCS: GetTickets(deptid: 2, limitnum: 100)
        WHMCS -> DB: SELECT * FROM tickets WHERE deptid = 2
        DB -> WHMCS: Support Tickets
        WHMCS -> WS: Support Department Results
    and Billing Department Search  
        WS -> WHMCS: GetTickets(deptid: 3, limitnum: 100)
        WHMCS -> DB: SELECT * FROM tickets WHERE deptid = 3
        DB -> WHMCS: Billing Tickets
        WHMCS -> WS: Billing Department Results
    end
    
    WS -> WS: Search for ticket in department results
    
    alt Ticket Found in Department
        WS -> WHMCS: GetTicket(ticketid: found_ticket_id)
        WHMCS -> WS: Full Ticket Details
        note right of WS: searchMethod = "department_support"\nor "department_billing"
    else Ticket Not Found
        WS -> TC: Error: "Ticket not found"
        TC -> API: 404 Not Found
        API -> C: {"success":false,"error":"Ticket not found"}
        stop
    end
end

== Client Validation ==
WS -> WS: Extract userid from ticket
WS -> WHMCS: GetClientsDetails(clientid: userid)
WHMCS -> DB: SELECT * FROM clients WHERE id = userid
DB -> WHMCS: Client Data
WHMCS -> WS: Client Details

alt Client Not Found
    WS -> TC: Error: "Client not found"
    TC -> API: 404 Not Found
    API -> C: {"success":false,"error":"Client not found"}
    stop
end

== Phone Number Validation ==
WS -> WS: **Phone Validation Process**
note right of WS: • Normalize both numbers\n• Remove spaces, dashes, parentheses\n• Check exact match\n• Check partial matches

WS -> WS: normalizePhone(clientPhone)\nnormalizePhone(providedPhone)
WS -> WS: Compare normalized numbers

alt Phone Numbers Match
    note right of WS: phoneValidated = true
else Phone Numbers Don't Match
    WS -> WS: Create masked registered phone\n(first 4 + *** + last 3)
    WS -> TC: Error: "Please contact from your\nregistered number 3335***646"
    TC -> API: 403 Forbidden
    API -> C: {"success":false,\n"error":"Please contact from your\nregistered number 3335***646"}
    stop
end

== Success Response ==
WS -> TC: Return validated ticket data\n{ticket, client, phoneValidated,\nsearchMethod, departmentId}

TC -> TC: **Format Ticket Summary**
note right of TC: • ticketId, ticketNumber\n• subject, status, priority\n• department, departmentId\n• client details\n• validation info\n• search method

TC -> TC: generateTicketSummary(ticketData, clientData)

TC -> API: 200 OK\n{"success":true,"ticket":{...}}
API -> C: **Complete Ticket Summary**

note over C: Response includes:\n• Ticket details (ID, subject, status)\n• Client information (name, email)\n• Department information\n• Search method used\n• Validation status\n• Human-readable summary

== Response Examples ==

note over API: **Success Response:**\n{\n  "success": true,\n  "ticket": {\n    "ticketNumber": "139242",\n    "subject": "Service Issue...",\n    "status": "In Progress",\n    "department": "Support",\n    "departmentId": "2",\n    "clientName": "Uzair Farooq",\n    "clientEmail": "uzair@example.com",\n    "phoneValidated": true,\n    "searchMethod": "direct",\n    "summary": "Ticket #139242 for Uzair Farooq..."\n  }\n}

note over API: **Error Responses:**\n• 400: Invalid parameters\n• 403: Phone mismatch with masked number\n• 404: Ticket/client not found\n• 500: Server error

@enduml